# THIRDEYE_AUTOWALK sequence, recorded with THIRDEYE_RECORD=1 (July 2026).
# EOB3 QSP session: title menu -> Continue the Quest -> load slot 1 (Quick
# Start Party) -> tour level 1 (movement, camp/space interactions) -> find the
# stairs and enter level 2 -> quit to title via the camp menu -> Abandon the
# Quest. Self-exits cleanly, so a valgrind run over it reports leaks past the
# real quit path (not a mid-flight snapshot).
#
# Requires the user's EOB3 install at RES's dir with a QSP save in slot 1
# (SAVEGAME/ITEMS.TMP + LVLnn.TMP present).
#
# Replay natively:  THIRDEYE_AUTOWALK=$(grep -v '^#' this_file | tr -d ' \n') \
#                     build/thirdeye ../data/EYE.RES --skip-intro --vm
# Under valgrind:   RES=../data/EYE.RES WALK=scripts/walks/eob3-qsp-l1-to-l2.walk \
#                     scripts/ci-valgrind.sh
